# Hero background footage, served to the browser — public by definition, so
# never put anything secret in a VITE_ variable.
#
# Leave it unset and the hero renders its CSS light field instead. That is a
# supported state, not a degraded one: the video is skipped anyway for anyone
# with prefers-reduced-motion, and whenever the file fails to load.
#
# Before pointing this at real footage, check what it weighs. The clip this was
# built against is 19 MB, which is more than the entire rest of the page and
# arrives before anyone has read the headline. Transcode to a few MB, serve
# webm alongside mp4, and host it somewhere you control rather than hotlinking
# someone else's CDN.
VITE_HERO_VIDEO=
